    - target: {fileID: 1294218355234163070, guid: e8ad99198f31346478dd3835b0a89e5e, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'A determined individual, the Marauder has dedicated his eternity to
        re-claiming his death.


        Hell-bent on gaining any semblance of peace,
        he will stop at nothing to finding the Scientist responsible for it all.


        But
        that''s not his main goal.


        He will find Life.


        He will
        kill her.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
